00:04:09.700 --> 00:04:12.560
be ads on YouTube" or "I just use ad block bro" or whatever.

00:04:13.360 --> 00:04:16.800
But the fact of the matter is YouTube would not exist

00:04:16.900 --> 00:04:18.980
if it wasn't for advertisement.

00:04:19.180 --> 00:04:20.780
That is an absolute fact.

00:04:20.980 --> 00:04:25.840
If you're not ok with that, then, there's nothing that can really be said for that.

00:04:25.840 --> 00:04:28.600
But assuming you are like most other people,

00:04:28.600 --> 00:04:30.580
